      "side": 1,
      "message": "More ideas from discussion with @arve@android.com:\n* Even if we call `PARTITION_INFO_GET` from the notification function, we could still do it 8 at a time, and maybe cache it across calls\n* We could parallelize the process a bit: notify all pending SPs first, then return and retry if at least one of them was busy\n* Add a test (when we get Hafnium running) with more SPs (e.g. 9)",
